<p>&#160;</p>
</div>
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Exit this mode by switching to another one –</span> <span class="Mode">Zoom Window</span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Mode">Zoom Mode</span><span lang="EN-GB">,</span> <span class="Mode">Rotate</span> <span lang="EN-GB">or</span> <span class="Mode">Pan</span><span lang="EN-GB">. This mode is not stored so when you open another window,</span> <span class="Mode">Zoom Window</span> <span lang="EN-GB">mode will be enabled.</span></p>
<p class="Use"><span class="Command">Interactive Cross Sections</span> <span lang="EN-GB">is extremely</span> <span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>useful</b></span> <span lang="EN-GB">as it allows the user to select exactly where they want the section. This allows a skilled surfacer to quickly extract the information required to produce a CAD model from the point data.</span></p>
